# Standalone wallets (Android)

Read `docs/AGENT_HANDOFF_STANDALONE_WALLETS.md` before changing wallet entry points.

Enable/disable is what the merchant passes. Do not add `SDKConfig` or UPP `setXEnabled` flags.

- UPP on: `setGooglePayConfig` / `setSamsungPayConfig`
- UPP off: omit those setters
- Standalone: `GooglePayLauncher` / `SamsungPayLauncher`
- Hybrid: standalone launchers + UPP without wallet configs

Map Google Pay accept/order `state` via `WalletPaymentStateMapper` (`AUTHORISED`, `CAPTURED`, `PURCHASED`, `POST_AUTH_REVIEW`). Never hard-code Captured.

Sister iOS branch: `feature/standalone-wallet-launchers` on `payment-sdk-ios`.
